{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <u><strong>multi-mode</strong></u>,\u00a0<u><strong>time-survival</strong></u>, featuring  <u><strong>roguelite</strong></u> elements, top-down perspective 2D pixel-art, support up to 8 multiplayer\u00a0<u><strong>online</strong></u>\u00a0<strong><u>co-op</u></strong>. Every level (include the tutorial level) is guarded by big <u><strong>boss</strong></u>, featuring challenging\u00a0<strong><u>rhythm-synchronized</u></strong> battle!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca1<strong>Game Tips</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill monsters, collect souls, upgrade your hero.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the map to discover teasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When events happen, stick with your teammates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the best pc owner be the server host.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ruler of The Hell, King Yama is tired of endless torture toward the sins, it's time to find out another solution that shows how precious is the human walfare. As a legendary warrior, do you agree with it?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2436350?t=1764234957","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2436350?t=1764234957","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436350/3d16b6c24160bc7774981dd923b87e0a98239852/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764234957","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436350/3d16b6c24160bc7774981dd923b87e0a98239852/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764234957","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Diffi